BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Street Car Cask Series
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260521
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261023
DTSTAMP:20260809T022900Z
UID:fbf9f2110ed2bb3ef7a03379d0c1735d@explore-edmonton-calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/refere
 nce/High-Level-Streetcar-11.JPG
DESCRIPTION:Local brews and stunning views!\n\nHop aboard the excitement o
 f the Street Car Cask Series\, one of Edmonton’s most iconic experiences
 !\n\nThe Common’s Street Car Cask Series returns from May through Octobe
 r\, rolling across the High Level Bridge every Thursday evening. Enjoy fre
 sh casks from some of Alberta’s best craft breweries\, with a rotating l
 ineup of local favourites and exclusive pours available only on board.\n\n
 Two casks ride with you\, with a third waiting at The Common. All the whil
 e\, golden hour stretches over the river valley!\n\nOnce you’re back on 
 solid ground\, the evening continues with live music\, light snacks\, and 
 an atmosphere that makes it an easy choice for date night or a relaxed out
 ing with friends and family.\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLocation: High Level Br
 idge Street Car\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nVisit / Tickets: https://www.th
 ecommon.ca/street-cars\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploreedmonton.com/even
 t-calendar/street-car-cask-series
LAST-MODIFIED:20260809T022853Z
LOCATION:High Level Bridge Street Car\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/street-car-cask-series
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>Local brews and stunning views!</p><p>Hop 
 aboard the excitement of the Street Car Cask Series\, one of Edmonton’s 
 most iconic experiences!</p><p>The Common’s Street Car Cask Series retur
 ns from May through October\, rolling across the High Level Bridge every T
 hursday evening. Enjoy fresh casks from some of Alberta’s best craft bre
 weries\, with a rotating lineup of local favourites and exclusive pours av
 ailable only on board.</p><p>Two casks ride with you\, with a third waitin
 g at The Common. All the while\, golden hour stretches over the river vall
 ey!</p><p>Once you’re back on solid ground\, the evening continues with 
 live music\, light snacks\, and an atmosphere that makes it an easy choice
  for date night or a relaxed outing with friends and family.</p><h3>Event 
 Information</h3><ul><li><strong>Location:</strong> High Level Bridge Stree
 t Car\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA</li><li><strong>Visit / Tickets:</strong> 
 https://www.thecommon.ca/street-cars</li><li><strong>Explore Edmonton:</st
 rong> https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/street-car-cask-series</l
 i></ul>
X-IMAGE:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/reference/High-Level-Str
 eetcar-11.JPG
X-TICKETS-URL:https://www.thecommon.ca/street-cars
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jubilations Dinner Theatre: Golden Girls Vegas Vacation
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260619
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260824
DTSTAMP:20260809T022900Z
UID:758faa5ae7b1f075de1cf91141ec55b1@explore-edmonton-calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/IMG_78
 39.JPG
DESCRIPTION:The Golden Girls are headed to Vegas!\n\nEveryone’s favourit
 e golden group of lovely ladies is hitting the Las Vegas strip in this Jub
 ilations Dinner show! The girls have decided that it’s finally time to t
 ake that bachelorette trip that none of them got to take in their youth. I
 t’s never too late when you’re young at heart. There will be big laugh
 s and amazing music from all the greatest singers that have hit the strip 
 through the years.\n\nTake in the excitement (and stunning live vocals) wh
 ile you enjoy a delicious multi-course meal served by an incredible cast o
 f character servers. It’s a live show\, so anything could happen. Play a
 long and the actors might just include you in the act!\n\nEVENT INFORMATIO
 N\nLocation: Jubilations Dinner Theatre - 8882 170 St\, Edmonton\, Alberta
 \, CA\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/golden
 -girls-vegas-vacation
LAST-MODIFIED:20260809T022836Z
LOCATION:Jubilations Dinner Theatre - 8882 170 St\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, C
 A
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/golden-girls-vegas-vacation
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>The Golden Girls are headed to Vegas!</p><
 p>Everyone’s favourite golden group of lovely ladies is hitting the Las 
 Vegas strip in this Jubilations Dinner show! The girls have decided that i
 t’s finally time to take that bachelorette trip that none of them got to
  take in their youth. It’s never too late when you’re young at heart. 
 There will be big laughs and amazing music from all the greatest singers t
 hat have hit the strip through the years.</p><p>Take in the excitement (an
 d stunning live vocals) while you enjoy a delicious multi-course meal serv
 ed by an incredible cast of character servers. It’s a live show\, so any
 thing could happen. Play along and the actors might just include you in th
 e act!</p><h3>Event Information</h3><ul><li><strong>Location:</strong> Jub
 ilations Dinner Theatre - 8882 170 St\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA</li><li><s
 trong>Explore Edmonton:</strong> https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calenda
 r/golden-girls-vegas-vacation</li></ul>
X-IMAGE:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/IMG_7839.JPG
END:VEVENT
