DESCRIPTION:Come early\, stay late\, and enjoy everything the area has to 
 offer!\n\nSummer Block Party is bringing summer vibes to Rice Howard Way i
 n downtown every Saturday until September 19\, 2026.\n\nWatch as the stree
 t comes alive with live music\, local artists\, patio vibes\, participatin
 g businesses\, and pop-up programming along one of the city’s most iconi
 c streets. Whether you’re planning a full day downtown or just looking f
 or a fun stop to add to your evening\, it’s the perfect place to soak up
  the atmosphere\, support local businesses\, and enjoy the best of the sum
 mer season!\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nSchedule: Jun 20\, 2026\, Jun 27\, 2026\
 , Jul 4\, 2026\, Jul 11\, 2026\, Jul 18\, 2026\, Jul 25\, 2026\, Aug 1\, 2
 026\, Aug 8\, 2026\, Aug 15\, 2026\, Aug 22\, 2026\, Aug 29\, 2026\, Sep 5
 \, 2026\, Sep 12\, 2026\, Sep 19\, 2026\nLocation: Rice Howard Way - Rice 
 Howard Wy\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nVisit / Tickets: https://www.foundrye
 vents.ca/summer-block-party\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploreedmonton.com
 /event-calendar/summer-block-party
LAST-MODIFIED:20260809T022853Z
LOCATION:Rice Howard Way - Rice Howard Wy\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA
