DESCRIPTION:Cheer on the future of hockey!\n\nThis summer\, see some of th
 e best under-18 hockey players in the world play in Edmonton during the 20
 26 Hlinka Gretzky Cup\, happening August 3-8 at Rogers Place! The Hlinka G
 retzky Cup is a showcase of the next generation\, highlighting future firs
 t-round draft picks. Just look at the 2026 edition of Canada’s National 
 Junior Team: 16 of the 25 players who wore the Maple Leaf at the 2026 Worl
 d Juniors were Hlinka Gretzky Cup alumni. National teams from Canada\, USA
 \, Sweden\, Switzerland\, and more will put their skates on the ice at Rog
 ers Place to win this year's Hlinka Gretzky Cup. Don't miss it this August
 !\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLocation: Rogers Place - 10220 104 Ave NW\, Edmont
 on\, Alberta\, CA\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploreedmonton.com/event-cal
 endar/2026-hlinkagretzkycup
