 teams from Canada\, USA\, Sweden\, Switzerland\, and more will put their s
 kates on the ice at Rogers Place to win this year&#x27\;s Hlinka Gretzky C
 up. Don&#x27\;t miss it this August!</p><h3>Event Information</h3><ul><li>
