BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Edmonton Folk Music Festival
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260806
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260810
DTSTAMP:20260809T022900Z
UID:ed512d4d61579b3a6e56fb34e0bae1ed@explore-edmonton-calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/featur
 e/Edmonton-International-Folk-Music-Festival_17-large.jpg
DESCRIPTION:A dizzying four days of music and great food in a stellar sett
 ing.\n\nThe jam-packed four days of folk music\, great food and a stellar 
 setting during the Edmonton Folk Music Festival has become a summer instit
 ution in the city.\n\nSlip into a low lawn chair and take in the backdrop 
 of the city skyline and the grassy slope down Gallagher Hill towards the m
 ain stage nestled in a natural amphitheatre\, the epicenter of a much-anti
 cipated annual August homage to all things musical. An eclectic line-up of
  bands from around the globe will have you toe-tapping in time. The event
 ’s vibe is unique with jam sessions and lesser-known acts occupying seve
 ral smaller stages\, and rumours drifting of big-time bands joining up for
  epic surprise musical unions.\n\nThe festival is kid-friendly – eleven 
 and under get in free – and it’s also a community event with over 2\,5
 00 volunteers hell-bent on bringing the world’s best folk music to North
 ern Alberta with a good dose of fun. An army of food vendors cooks up a va
 st array of international delicacies\, and there’s a lively beer garden 
 as well with a selection of brews to quench your thirst and soothe your th
 roat after all that spirited singing along.\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLocation
 : Gallagher Park - 9505 96 Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nVisit / Tickets:
  https://edmontonfolkfest.org\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploreedmonton.c
 om/event-calendar/edmonton-folk-music-festival
LAST-MODIFIED:20260809T022831Z
LOCATION:Gallagher Park - 9505 96 Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/edmonton-folk-music-festiva
 l
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>A dizzying four days of music and great fo
 od in a stellar setting.</p><p>The jam-packed four days of folk music\, gr
 eat food and a stellar setting during the Edmonton Folk Music Festival has
  become a summer institution in the city.</p><p>Slip into a low lawn chair
  and take in the backdrop of the city skyline and the grassy slope down Ga
 llagher Hill towards the main stage nestled in a natural amphitheatre\, th
 e epicenter of a much-anticipated annual August homage to all things music
 al. An eclectic line-up of bands from around the globe will have you toe-t
 apping in time. The event’s vibe is unique with jam sessions and lesser-
 known acts occupying several smaller stages\, and rumours drifting of big-
 time bands joining up for epic surprise musical unions.</p><p>The festival
  is kid-friendly – eleven and under get in free – and it’s also a co
 mmunity event with over 2\,500 volunteers hell-bent on bringing the world
 ’s best folk music to Northern Alberta with a good dose of fun. An army 
 of food vendors cooks up a vast array of international delicacies\, and th
 ere’s a lively beer garden as well with a selection of brews to quench y
 our thirst and soothe your throat after all that spirited singing along.</
 p><h3>Event Information</h3><ul><li><strong>Location:</strong> Gallagher P
 ark - 9505 96 Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA</li><li><strong>Visit / Ticket
 s:</strong> https://edmontonfolkfest.org</li><li><strong>Explore Edmonton:
 </strong> https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/edmonton-folk-music-f
 estival</li></ul>
X-IMAGE:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/feature/Edmonton-Interna
 tional-Folk-Music-Festival_17-large.jpg
X-TICKETS-URL:https://edmontonfolkfest.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cariwest Caribbean Arts Festival
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260807
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260810
DTSTAMP:20260809T022900Z
UID:af261f2d9fb4e75962715a78681671d6@explore-edmonton-calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/listin
 gs/Cariwest-Caribbean-Arts-Festival_A-large-group-dances-and-waves-colourf
 ul-flags-past-the-Fairmont-Hotel-Macdonald-during-the-parade-medium.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Don't miss three party-filled days of Caribbean culture in the
  heart of downtown!\n\nCariwest\, Edmonton's annual celebration of Caribbe
 an arts\, music\, and culture\, brings a fully licensed party to Churchill
  Square this summer! This year’s festivities include special events\, pe
 rformances\, and exhibitions commemorating this milestone and honouring th
 e founders\, volunteers\, and participants who have shaped the festival ov
 er the years. The 3-day event includes a Costume Extravaganza\, the iconic
  Saturday Cariwest Parade\, and a Caribbean Village throughout the weekend
  with live entertainment\, Kids Korner\, savory Caribbean cuisine\, the Ca
 ribbean Marketplace\, and more! Cariwest Parade At the heart of Cariwest i
 s its iconic parade. Make your way downtown and shake your tail feathers w
 ith Cariwest masqueraders! The annual Cariwest Parade returns to the stree
 ts of Edmonton on Saturday\, August 8. Follow Cariwest on Facebook and Ins
 tagram to stay up to date on the latest regarding times and routes. You do
 n't want to miss this!\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLocation: Sir Winston Churchi
 ll Square\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploreedmo
 nton.com/event-calendar/cariwest-caribbean-arts-festival
LAST-MODIFIED:20260809T022825Z
LOCATION:Sir Winston Churchill Square\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/cariwest-caribbean-arts-fes
 tival
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>Don&#x27\;t miss three party-filled days o
 f Caribbean culture in the heart of downtown!</p><p>Cariwest\, Edmonton&#x
 27\;s annual celebration of Caribbean arts\, music\, and culture\, brings 
 a fully licensed party to Churchill Square this summer! This year’s fest
 ivities include special events\, performances\, and exhibitions commemorat
 ing this milestone and honouring the founders\, volunteers\, and participa
 nts who have shaped the festival over the years. The 3-day event includes 
 a Costume Extravaganza\, the iconic Saturday Cariwest Parade\, and a Carib
 bean Village throughout the weekend with live entertainment\, Kids Korner\
 , savory Caribbean cuisine\, the Caribbean Marketplace\, and more! Cariwes
 t Parade At the heart of Cariwest is its iconic parade. Make your way down
 town and shake your tail feathers with Cariwest masqueraders! The annual C
 ariwest Parade returns to the streets of Edmonton on Saturday\, August 8. 
 Follow Cariwest on Facebook and Instagram to stay up to date on the latest
  regarding times and routes. You don&#x27\;t want to miss this!</p><h3>Eve
 nt Information</h3><ul><li><strong>Location:</strong> Sir Winston Churchil
 l Square\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA</li><li><strong>Explore Edmonton:</stro
 ng> https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/cariwest-caribbean-arts-fes
 tival</li></ul>
