BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Chinatown Classic: 9-Man Volleyball Festival
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260808
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260810
DTSTAMP:20260809T022900Z
UID:65d39064a37aae3765b43cc2079f5006@explore-edmonton-calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/202606
 06-XUANWU9MANVB-342.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Be part of sporting history!\n\nThis August\, Edmonton's China
 town will make Canadian history by hosting the inaugural Chinatown Classic
 \, the first major 9-man volleyball tournament to be played on the city's 
 new outdoor 9-man volleyball courts. Located on 98 Street\, these courts m
 ark a historic milestone for North America. Despite the sport's more than 
 90-year legacy\, only one other outdoor 9-man volleyball court exists on t
 he continent\, in New York City.\n\nHosted by Ignite Sports and the Edmont
 on Xuan Wu Volleyball Club\, the tournament will bring together men's 9-ma
 n volleyball and women's 6s teams from across Western Canada and beyond fo
 r a weekend of high-level competition\, culture\, and community. Teams inc
 lude Calgary Dynasty 卡城排球\, Toronto 狐狸 Fury\, Ottawa Mystics\,
  Hon Hsing Athletic Club of Vancouver (雲高華漢升體育會)\, Vancouv
 er Venom\, Vancouver Nimbus\, and the Wongs' Benevolent Association of Can
 ada.\n\nMore than a tournament\, the Chinatown Classic celebrates one of N
 orth America's oldest Chinese sporting traditions. Spectators can watch ex
 citing matches throughout the weekend while exploring Chinatown's restaura
 nts\, cafés\, and local businesses. The event will also feature lion danc
 e performances\, an artisan market\, and an outdoor mahjong lounge\, creat
 ing a vibrant festival atmosphere for all ages.\n\nAdmission is free\, and
  everyone is invited to cheer on the athletes and be part of this historic
  event.\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLocation: Chinatown Courts\, 98 Street\, bet
 ween 105-106 Avenue\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nExplore Edmonton: https://e
 xploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/chinatown-classic-9-man-volleyball-festi
 val
LAST-MODIFIED:20260809T022825Z
LOCATION:Chinatown Courts\, 98 Street\, between 105-106 Avenue\, Edmonton\
 , Alberta\, CA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/chinatown-classic-9-man-vol
 leyball-festival
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>Be part of sporting history!</p><p>This Au
 gust\, Edmonton&#x27\;s Chinatown will make Canadian history by hosting th
 e inaugural Chinatown Classic\, the first major 9-man volleyball tournamen
 t to be played on the city&#x27\;s new outdoor 9-man volleyball courts. Lo
 cated on 98 Street\, these courts mark a historic milestone for North Amer
 ica. Despite the sport&#x27\;s more than 90-year legacy\, only one other o
 utdoor 9-man volleyball court exists on the continent\, in New York City.<
 /p><p>Hosted by Ignite Sports and the Edmonton Xuan Wu Volleyball Club\, t
 he tournament will bring together men&#x27\;s 9-man volleyball and women&#
 x27\;s 6s teams from across Western Canada and beyond for a weekend of hig
 h-level competition\, culture\, and community. Teams include Calgary Dynas
 ty 卡城排球\, Toronto 狐狸 Fury\, Ottawa Mystics\, Hon Hsing Athleti
 c Club of Vancouver (雲高華漢升體育會)\, Vancouver Venom\, Vancouv
 er Nimbus\, and the Wongs&#x27\; Benevolent Association of Canada.</p><p>M
 ore than a tournament\, the Chinatown Classic celebrates one of North Amer
 ica&#x27\;s oldest Chinese sporting traditions. Spectators can watch excit
 ing matches throughout the weekend while exploring Chinatown&#x27\;s resta
 urants\, cafés\, and local businesses. The event will also feature lion d
 ance performances\, an artisan market\, and an outdoor mahjong lounge\, cr
 eating a vibrant festival atmosphere for all ages.</p><p>Admission is free
 \, and everyone is invited to cheer on the athletes and be part of this hi
 storic event.</p><h3>Event Information</h3><ul><li><strong>Location:</stro
 ng> Chinatown Courts\, 98 Street\, between 105-106 Avenue\, Edmonton\, Alb
 erta\, CA</li><li><strong>Explore Edmonton:</strong> https://exploreedmont
 on.com/event-calendar/chinatown-classic-9-man-volleyball-festival</li></ul
 >
