DESCRIPTION:Gather around for an evening of camp-inspired fun\, craft beve
 rages\, and after-hours access to the Alberta Aviation Museum.\n\nThe next
  Props & Hops has arrived\, and this time the Alberta Aviation Museum is t
 ransforming into the ultimate summer camp experience for grown-ups!\n\nGue
 sts are invited to an adults-only evening surrounded by historic aircraft\
 , where aviation meets the best parts of camp life. Expect nostalgic games
 \, live music\, local drinks\, and classic campfire-inspired experiences. 
 Whether reliving favourite childhood camp memories or simply looking for a
  unique night out with friends\, this is an opportunity to experience the 
 museum after hours in a whole new way.\n\nThe evening features a drink tic
 ket system\, allowing guests to sample a variety of offerings from local b
 reweries and distilleries. Sip\, explore\, and discover new favourites whi
 le making your way through camp-inspired activities throughout the museum!
 \n\nAccess to the museum's flight simulators for an immersive aviation exp
 erience\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLocation: Alberta Aviation Museum - 11410 Ki
 ngsway\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploreedmonto
 n.com/event-calendar/props-and-hops
