DESCRIPTION:Celebrate culture\, connection\, inclusivity and so much more 
 this August!\n\nThe Reggae Festival is a vibrant community celebration fil
 led with music\, culture\, food\, and entertainment. Guests can expect a w
 elcoming and family-friendly atmosphere featuring live reggae performances
  from talented local\, national\, and international artists representing a
  variety of reggae styles and Caribbean influences!\n\nAttendees will expe
 rience energetic performances\, DJs\, cultural showcases\, and positive vi
 bes throughout the day. The festival will also include food vendors offeri
 ng Caribbean cuisine\, artisan and marketplace vendors\, community exhibit
 ors\, cultural presentations\, and activities for families and youth.\n\nT
 he event is designed to bring people together through music and culture wh
 ile promoting unity\, diversity\, and community connection. Guests should 
 expect an exciting\, safe\, and inclusive environment celebrating Caribbea
 n heritage\, reggae music\, and the spirit of togetherness.\n\nEVENT INFOR
 MATION\nLocation: Heritage Amphitheatre - William Hawrelak Park\, 9330 Gro
 at Rd\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nVisit / Tickets: https://edmontonreggaefe
 stivalsociety.ca/\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploreedmonton.com/event-cal
 endar/edmonton-love-unity-reggae-festival
