ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/DSC_76
 28.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Walls become canvases as the Edmonton Mural Festival returns f
 or its biggest year yet!\n\nThis summer\, Edmonton transforms into a massi
 ve open-air gallery\, showcasing spectacular new murals by some of the cit
 y's most exciting homegrown artists alongside a curated lineup of acclaime
 d muralists from across Canada and around the world. From towering landmar
 k pieces to hidden creative gems\, every mural tells a story\, becoming a 
 lasting part of Edmonton's cultural landscape and inviting visitors to exp
 erience the city through a new lens.\n\nSpark your imagination as you disc
 over larger-than-life artworks\, meet the artists behind the paint on city
 -wide tours\, and immerse yourself in a month-long celebration of colour\,
  creativity\, and vibrancy across Edmonton.\n\nOld Strathcona (August 19)\
 n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLocation: Various locations\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, C
 A\nVisit / Tickets: https://www.edmontonmuralfest.com/\nExplore Edmonton: 
 https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/edmonton-mural-festival
LAST-MODIFIED:20260809T022832Z
LOCATION:Various locations\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/edmonton-mural-festival
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>Walls become canvases as the Edmonton Mura
 l Festival returns for its biggest year yet!</p><p>This summer\, Edmonton 
 transforms into a massive open-air gallery\, showcasing spectacular new mu
 rals by some of the city&#x27\;s most exciting homegrown artists alongside
  a curated lineup of acclaimed muralists from across Canada and around the
  world. From towering landmark pieces to hidden creative gems\, every mura
 l tells a story\, becoming a lasting part of Edmonton&#x27\;s cultural lan
 dscape and inviting visitors to experience the city through a new lens.</p
 ><p>Spark your imagination as you discover larger-than-life artworks\, mee
 t the artists behind the paint on city-wide tours\, and immerse yourself i
 n a month-long celebration of colour\, creativity\, and vibrancy across Ed
 monton.</p><p>Old Strathcona (August 19)</p><h3>Event Information</h3><ul>
 <li><strong>Location:</strong> Various locations\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA
 </li><li><strong>Visit / Tickets:</strong> https://www.edmontonmuralfest.c
 om/</li><li><strong>Explore Edmonton:</strong> https://exploreedmonton.com
 /event-calendar/edmonton-mural-festival</li></ul>
X-IMAGE:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/DSC_7628.jpg
X-TICKETS-URL:https://www.edmontonmuralfest.com/
END:VEVENT
