 od cooked over open fire\, and the sun setting over the prairie!\n\nFarm t
 o Folk is a one-night celebration during Alberta Open Farm Days filled wit
 h music\, food\, and community at The Old Red Barn. Bring your lawn chair\
 , kick back\, and enjoy an unforgettable outdoor concert featuring Kim Gat
 es and Samantha Lee. As the music fills the air\, Chef Tyson Wright will s
 erve a delicious fire cooked menu that showcases the best local ingredient
 s and the bold flavors that have made our farm dining experiences so memor
 able!\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLocation: The Old Red Barn - 25518 Township Ro
 ad 490\, Leduc County\, Alberta\, CA\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploreedm
 onton.com/event-calendar/farm-to-fork
