BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Meteor Shower Watchparty
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260815
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260817
DTSTAMP:20260809T022900Z
UID:76638f0b21a8f454b978c0bebe80c9df@explore-edmonton-calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/galler
 y/Edmonton_Southside_Saskatchewan-Drive-Lookout-Night.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Experience stargazing under the summer sky!\n\nThere are ancie
 nt cycles all around us - on the land and in the skies above. From migrati
 ng birds to the glow of fireflies\, these natural wonders depend on dark\,
  undisturbed night skies.\n\nEach August\, the Perseid meteor shower light
 s up the sky as Earth passes through the trail of debris left by Comet 109
 P/Swift–Tuttle\, a celestial visitor that returns to our solar system ju
 st once every 133 years.\n\nCelebrate these timeless cycles with an unforg
 ettable evening dedicated to conservation\, dark skies\, and our shared cu
 ltural heritage. The experience begins with guided nature walks before gue
 sts gather around the campfire to make bannock on a stick and hear stories
  of the sky and forest shared by Knowledge Keepers\, helping keep these an
 cient traditions alive. As night falls\, explore the cosmos through telesc
 opes\, enjoy hands-on crafts\, and create dazzling long-exposure light pai
 ntings beneath the stars.\n\nPlease note: This event takes place outside t
 he city. A shuttle bus is available for a $10 fee\, with pickup locations 
 at Northgate Centre\, Stadium Station\, Mill Woods\, Southgate Centre \, a
 nd West Edmonton Mall . Please visit the event website for pickup times an
 d location details.\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLocation: 20414 Township Rd 502 
 - 20414 Township Rd 502\, Kingman\, Alberta\, CA\nVisit / Tickets: https:/
 /www.eventbrite.ca/e/meteor-shower-watchparty-tickets-1992598626130?sg=2b7
 7898762acff87c83cca8751f108e2c992eb23a86b56f302cfd54739a7519644b7ef4615129
 4609da6f8f206c72c1821de8a0d50d6b367841b4404b844772bfc71ca35167b691cff0c782
 c01&aff=ebdsshios\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploreedmonton.com/event-cal
 endar/meteor-shower-watchparty
LAST-MODIFIED:20260809T022845Z
LOCATION:20414 Township Rd 502 - 20414 Township Rd 502\, Kingman\, Alberta
 \, CA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/meteor-shower-watchparty
