BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Spill the T - Drag: Beyond the Performance
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260819
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260820
DTSTAMP:20260809T022900Z
UID:75f5e687645c279f4dfcb6acbca4241b@explore-edmonton-calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/McDoug
 all-Hill-Lookout_A-view-of-the-Muttart-Conservatory-pyramids-and-the-Low-L
 evel-Bridge-with-some-pink-trees-in-the-foreground-medium.jpg
DESCRIPTION:A series of conversations\, stories\, and connections that cel
 ebrate 2SLGBTQIA+ communities and build understanding across Edmonton.\n\n
 Kirk Centre has partnered with Robertson-Wesley United Church and the Huma
 n Library to host a series of events called Spill the T . This series will
  feature several events focused on 2SLGBTQIA+ topics\, with the goal of pr
 omoting education\, connection\, and understanding within the 2SLGBTQIA+ c
 ommunity. Through these events\, the series aims to help foster more inclu
 sive and welcoming spaces throughout Edmonton!\n\nAll events in the series
  are free to attend\, and ASL interpreters will be provided at each event 
 to support accessibility and ensure an inclusive experience for all attend
 ees.\n\nThe first event will focus on the drag community! An emcee will gu
 ide the event\, while two presenters from the drag community will begin th
 e evening by introducing and discussing topics relevant to the community. 
 The event will then transition into the Human Library portion\, where the 
 presenters and other community representatives will host tables focused on
  the topics explored during the presentations. Attendees will have the opp
 ortunity to visit these tables\, ask questions\, and engage in meaningful 
 conversations with presenters and community representatives.\n\nEVENT INFO
 RMATION\nLocation: Kirk Centre - 13535 122 Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\n
 Visit / Tickets: https://spillthetedm.ca/\nExplore Edmonton: https://explo
 reedmonton.com/event-calendar/spill-the-t-drag-beyond-the-performance
LAST-MODIFIED:20260809T022852Z
LOCATION:Kirk Centre - 13535 122 Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/spill-the-t-drag-beyond-the
 -performance
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>A series of conversations\, stories\, and 
 connections that celebrate 2SLGBTQIA+ communities and build understanding 
 across Edmonton.</p><p>Kirk Centre has partnered with Robertson-Wesley Uni
 ted Church and the Human Library to host a series of events called Spill t
 he T . This series will feature several events focused on 2SLGBTQIA+ topic
 s\, with the goal of promoting education\, connection\, and understanding 
 within the 2SLGBTQIA+ community. Through these events\, the series aims to
  help foster more inclusive and welcoming spaces throughout Edmonton!</p><
 p>All events in the series are free to attend\, and ASL interpreters will 
 be provided at each event to support accessibility and ensure an inclusive
  experience for all attendees.</p><p>The first event will focus on the dra
 g community! An emcee will guide the event\, while two presenters from the
  drag community will begin the evening by introducing and discussing topic
 s relevant to the community. The event will then transition into the Human
  Library portion\, where the presenters and other community representative
 s will host tables focused on the topics explored during the presentations
 . Attendees will have the opportunity to visit these tables\, ask question
 s\, and engage in meaningful conversations with presenters and community r
 epresentatives.</p><h3>Event Information</h3><ul><li><strong>Location:</st
 rong> Kirk Centre - 13535 122 Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA</li><li><stron
 g>Visit / Tickets:</strong> https://spillthetedm.ca/</li><li><strong>Explo
 re Edmonton:</strong> https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/spill-the
 -t-drag-beyond-the-performance</li></ul>
X-IMAGE:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/McDougall-Hill-Lookout_A
 -view-of-the-Muttart-Conservatory-pyramids-and-the-Low-Level-Bridge-with-s
 ome-pink-trees-in-the-foreground-medium.jpg
X-TICKETS-URL:https://spillthetedm.ca/
