DESCRIPTION:Drink\, dine\, and dance at the final Zoobrew of the summer!\n
 \nAre you ready to embark on a wild adventure like no other? The Valley Zo
 o Development Society invites you to Zoobrew\, the ultimate event for anim
 al lovers and craft beverage enthusiasts alike!\n\nDuring this annual summ
 er event\, guests can experience the magic of the Edmonton Valley Zoo afte
 r hours while enjoying a drink in hand. As the sun sets\, the zoo transfor
 ms into a relaxed adults-only atmosphere\, perfect for a night out with fr
 iends\, a unique date night with your significant otter\, or simply an eve
 ning to unwind.\n\nAs you explore the zoo's exhibits\, you'll have the cha
 nce to sample craft beer\, spirits\, and cider from some of the region's t
 op breweries and distilleries. And of course\, no visit would be complete 
 without seeing some of the zoo's famous furry residents along the way!\n\n
 EVENT INFORMATION\nLocation: Edmonton Valley Zoo - 13315 Buena Vista Rd\, 
 Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploreedmonton.com/eve
 nt-calendar/zoobrew-vol-3
