 nce/AHP210911_2011.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Grab your tickets\, gather your crew\, and join the celebratio
 n at the Canadian Derby!\n\nGet ready for the thrill of the 97th Canadian 
 Derby at Century Mile! This iconic event brings heart pounding races\, ele
 ctric energy\, and unforgettable moments all in one spectacular day. The t
 rack comes alive as top horses thunder toward the finish line and the crow
 d roars with excitement.\n\nFeel the rush of live horse racing\, savour de
 licious food and drinks\, and soak up the vibrant atmosphere. Fashion take
 s centre stage with bold hats and standout looks in the annual style conte
 st\, adding a touch of glamour and plenty of photo worthy moments. It’s 
 your chance to celebrate\, connect\, and be part of a tradition that has b
 een lighting up Edmonton for nearly a century.\n\nStake races include the 
 Century Casino Oaks\, the Northlands Distaff Handicap\, the Dale “The Co
 lonel” Saunders Speed To Spare Championship\, and the legendary Canadian
  Derby.\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLocation: Century Mile Racetrack & Casino - 
 4711 Airport Perimeter Rd\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nExplore Edmonton: htt
 ps://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/97th-running-of-the-canadian-derby
LAST-MODIFIED:20260809T022817Z
