  join the celebration at the Canadian Derby!</p><p>Get ready for the thril
 l of the 97th Canadian Derby at Century Mile! This iconic event brings hea
 rt pounding races\, electric energy\, and unforgettable moments all in one
  spectacular day. The track comes alive as top horses thunder toward the f
 inish line and the crowd roars with excitement.</p><p>Feel the rush of liv
 e horse racing\, savour delicious food and drinks\, and soak up the vibran
 t atmosphere. Fashion takes centre stage with bold hats and standout looks
  in the annual style contest\, adding a touch of glamour and plenty of pho
 to worthy moments. It’s your chance to celebrate\, connect\, and be part
  of a tradition that has been lighting up Edmonton for nearly a century.</
 p><p>Stake races include the Century Casino Oaks\, the Northlands Distaff 
