BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dîner en Blanc Edmonton
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260828
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260829
DTSTAMP:20260809T022900Z
UID:820c09d0357665a1eb8d2c64c87b864f@explore-edmonton-calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/Edmont
 on-Cityscape-Summer-Sunset.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Experience an elegant and unforgettable evening!\n\nPart of a 
 celebrated international tradition spanning more than 120 cities worldwide
 \, Dîner en Blanc transforms a secret outdoor location into a spectacular
  sea of white for one magical night. Guests\, dressed entirely in white\, 
 gather with friends to enjoy an elegant picnic\, live entertainment\, danc
 ing\, and unforgettable moments beneath the open sky. The event location r
 emains a closely guarded secret until guests depart from designated meetin
 g points on the day of the event\, adding an element of excitement and ant
 icipation.\n\nHosted by DASCH Productions\, the 2026 edition promises to e
 levate the experience with enhanced entertainment\, immersive experiences\
 , and a spectacular first-of-its-kind feature for a Dîner en Blanc event 
 in Western Canada!\n\nDress in your finest white attire\, gather your gues
 t\, and prepare to experience an extraordinary celebration of food\, fashi
 on\, community\, and joie de vivre.\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLocation: Secret
  location\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploreedmo
 nton.com/event-calendar/diner-en-blanc-edmonton
LAST-MODIFIED:20260809T022829Z
LOCATION:Secret location\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/diner-en-blanc-edmonton
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>Experience an elegant and unforgettable ev
 ening!</p><p>Part of a celebrated international tradition spanning more th
 an 120 cities worldwide\, Dîner en Blanc transforms a secret outdoor loca
 tion into a spectacular sea of white for one magical night. Guests\, dress
 ed entirely in white\, gather with friends to enjoy an elegant picnic\, li
 ve entertainment\, dancing\, and unforgettable moments beneath the open sk
 y. The event location remains a closely guarded secret until guests depart
  from designated meeting points on the day of the event\, adding an elemen
 t of excitement and anticipation.</p><p>Hosted by DASCH Productions\, the 
 2026 edition promises to elevate the experience with enhanced entertainmen
 t\, immersive experiences\, and a spectacular first-of-its-kind feature fo
 r a Dîner en Blanc event in Western Canada!</p><p>Dress in your finest wh
 ite attire\, gather your guest\, and prepare to experience an extraordinar
 y celebration of food\, fashion\, community\, and joie de vivre.</p><h3>Ev
 ent Information</h3><ul><li><strong>Location:</strong> Secret location\, E
 dmonton\, Alberta\, CA</li><li><strong>Explore Edmonton:</strong> https://
 exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/diner-en-blanc-edmonton</li></ul>
X-IMAGE:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/Edmonton-Cityscape-Summe
 r-Sunset.jpg
END:VEVENT
