 nce/IMG_7837.JPG
DESCRIPTION:Go back in time to the '80s\, no time machine required!\n\n"Oo
 ooh\, I love that song. You know\, the one that goes dun-de duh\, bee-dee-
 bop." It's a conversation almost everyone has had\, often followed by\, "I
 t's from the '80s!" What if there were a way to go back? Not just to the 1
 980s\, but to the exact moment that song was heard for the first time. The
  excitement\, the energy\, and the nostalgia of reliving those unforgettab
 le musical moments.\n\nAt Jubilations Dinner Theatre\, guests can enjoy a 
 delicious multi-course meal while taking in a live show packed with good v
 ibes. With character servers\, interactive comedy\, and plenty of surprise
 s along the way\, every performance is a little different. Audience member
 s might even find themselves becoming part of the show!\n\nEVENT INFORMATI
 ON\nLocation: Jubilations Dinner Theatre - 8882 170 St\, Edmonton\, Albert
 a\, CA\nVisit / Tickets: https://jubilations.ca/edmonton-shows/back-to-the
 -80s-the-magic-mix-tape/\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploreedmonton.com/ev
 ent-calendar/jubilations-dinner-theatre-back-to-the-80s-the-magic-mix-tape
