 e machine required!</p><p>&quot\;Ooooh\, I love that song. You know\, the 
 one that goes dun-de duh\, bee-dee-bop.&quot\; It&#x27\;s a conversation a
 lmost everyone has had\, often followed by\, &quot\;It&#x27\;s from the &#
 x27\;80s!&quot\; What if there were a way to go back? Not just to the 1980
 s\, but to the exact moment that song was heard for the first time. The ex
 citement\, the energy\, and the nostalgia of reliving those unforgettable 
