 e evening's shocking conclusion revealed Marz to be not only faking his ow
 n attack\, but also the perpetrator of the attack on "The Thickness" Reid 
 Matthews. This month\, LPW Grand Champion defends his title against The Sp
 ecialist - will Jackson earn a modicum of revenge for the devastating pack
 age piledriver delivered to him to close out LPW 50? Find out at LPW 51\, 
 live from the heart of South Edmonton Common!\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLocati
 on: The Rec Room South Edmonton Common\, 1725 99 St\, Edmonton\, Alberta\,
