 ith sizzling woks\, sweet skewers\, crispy fried favourites\, refreshing d
 rinks\, and plenty of new flavours to discover.\n\nCome hungry and be read
 y to explore. With so many delicious options\, choosing what to try next m
 ight be the hardest part!\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLocation: Louise McKinney 
 Riverfront Park\, 9999 Grierson Hill\, Edmonton\, AB\, CA\nExplore Edmonto
 n: https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/kejia-festival
