DESCRIPTION:Witness athletic greatness!\n\nWomen in Ninja (WIN) is Canada'
 s premier all-female ninja obstacle competition\, bringing together athlet
 es ages 5 to 50+ for a weekend of competition\, community\, and connection
 . Hosted at Edmonton's new Fitset Ninja facility\, WIN 2026 is an official
  UNAA World Finals Qualifier\, giving top athletes the chance to earn a sp
 ot at the 2027 World Finals!\n\nGuests can watch exciting head-to-head com
 petition on professionally designed obstacle courses\, cheer on athletes o
 f all experience levels\, browse local vendor booths\, and enjoy a fun\, f
 amily-friendly atmosphere. From first-time competitors to elite athletes\,
  Women in Ninja celebrates determination\, resilience\, and the growing co
 mmunity of women in the sport!\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLocation: Fitset Ninj
 a - 8520 106a Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nVisit / Tickets: https://www.
 womeninninja.com/\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploreedmonton.com/event-cal
 endar/women-in-ninja-2026
