  Ninja (WIN) is Canada&#x27\;s premier all-female ninja obstacle competiti
 on\, bringing together athletes ages 5 to 50+ for a weekend of competition
 \, community\, and connection. Hosted at Edmonton&#x27\;s new Fitset Ninja
  facility\, WIN 2026 is an official UNAA World Finals Qualifier\, giving t
 op athletes the chance to earn a spot at the 2027 World Finals!</p><p>Gues
 ts can watch exciting head-to-head competition on professionally designed 
