 RMTC-1.png
DESCRIPTION:A captivating whodunit mystery you won't want to miss!\n\nStep
  aboard the luxurious Orient Express and join Detective Hercule Poirot as 
 he travels alongside a cast of intriguing passengers - from the elegant Co
 untess and outspoken Mrs. Hubbard to the brash Colonel Arbuthnot and arist
 ocratic Princess Dragomiroff. When a shocking murder takes place overnight
 \, Poirot must rely on his legendary powers of observation and sharp atten
 tion to detail to unravel the mystery. As he pieces together clues\, motiv
 es\, hidden identities\, and long-buried secrets\, he races to uncover the
  killer in this gripping tale of revenge\, justice\, and deception.\n\nEVE
 NT INFORMATION\nLocation: Citadel Theatre - 9828 101A Ave\, Edmonton\, Alb
 erta\, CA\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/th
 e-citadel-theatre-murder-on-the-orient-express
