 sengers - from the elegant Countess and outspoken Mrs. Hubbard to the bras
 h Colonel Arbuthnot and aristocratic Princess Dragomiroff. When a shocking
  murder takes place overnight\, Poirot must rely on his legendary powers o
 f observation and sharp attention to detail to unravel the mystery. As he 
 pieces together clues\, motives\, hidden identities\, and long-buried secr
 ets\, he races to uncover the killer in this gripping tale of revenge\, ju
 stice\, and deception.</p><h3>Event Information</h3><ul><li><strong>Locati
