 s new musical flips the script on the greatest love story ever told. Get w
 hisked away on a fabulous journey as Juliet ditches her famous ending for 
 a fresh beginning and a second chance at life and love - her way. Juliet
 ’s new story bursts to life through a playlist of pop anthems as iconic 
 as her name\, including "Since U Been Gone‚" "Roar\," "Baby One More Tim
 e\," "Larger Than Life‚" "That’s The Way It Is\," and "Can't Stop the 
 Feeling!" - all from the genius songwriter/producer behind more #1 hits th
 an any other artist this century. Break free of the balcony scene and get 
 into this romantic comedy that proves there’s life after Romeo!\n\nEVENT
  INFORMATION\nLocation: Northern Alberta Jubilee Auditorium - 11455 87 Ave
 \, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nVisit / Tickets: https://edmonton.broadway.com
