 estival atmosphere!\n\nVisitors can explore more than 120 vendors\, includ
 ing over 40 Asian food vendors serving authentic dishes from across the co
 ntinent\, enjoy performances by more than 50 cultural groups\, and experie
 nce family activities\, artisan shopping\, community exhibits\, and more. 
 With a venue twice the size of last year\, AsiaFest 2026 offers a weekend 
 of food\, entertainment\, and cultural discovery for all ages. Admission i
 s free\, and everyone is welcome!\n\nYour guide to celebrating National In
