ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/2023-0
 9-09-Open-Cockpit-Day-by-Ezra-Jeffrey-39.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Calling all history buffs and aviation enthusiasts—this one 
 is for you!\n\nStep inside aviation history at an immersive event unlike a
 ny other. Explore more than 20 historic aircraft\, with over a dozen open 
 for guests to climb aboard. From sleek fighter jets to rugged bush planes 
 and everything in between\, experience the thrill of sitting in the cockpi
 t and imagining the skies these remarkable aircraft once commanded.\n\nThe
  adventure continues in the Alberta Aviation Museum's flight simulator lab
 \, where aspiring pilots can test their flying skills. Family-friendly act
 ivities throughout the museum offer hands-on fun for all ages\, while loca
 l food vendors serve up delicious bites to enjoy throughout the day!\n\nEV
 ENT INFORMATION\nLocation: Alberta Aviation Museum - 11410 Kingsway\, Edmo
 nton\, Alberta\, CA\nVisit / Tickets: https://albertaaviationmuseum.com/ev
 ents/open-cockpit-day/\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploreedmonton.com/even
 t-calendar/open-cockpit-day
LAST-MODIFIED:20260809T022847Z
LOCATION:Alberta Aviation Museum - 11410 Kingsway\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, C
 A
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/open-cockpit-day
