 husiasts—this one is for you!</p><p>Step inside aviation history at an i
 mmersive event unlike any other. Explore more than 20 historic aircraft\, 
 with over a dozen open for guests to climb aboard. From sleek fighter jets
  to rugged bush planes and everything in between\, experience the thrill o
 f sitting in the cockpit and imagining the skies these remarkable aircraft
  once commanded.</p><p>The adventure continues in the Alberta Aviation Mus
 eum&#x27\;s flight simulator lab\, where aspiring pilots can test their fl
 ying skills. Family-friendly activities throughout the museum offer hands-
 on fun for all ages\, while local food vendors serve up delicious bites to
  enjoy throughout the day!</p><h3>Event Information</h3><ul><li><strong>Lo
 cation:</strong> Alberta Aviation Museum - 11410 Kingsway\, Edmonton\, Alb
 erta\, CA</li><li><strong>Visit / Tickets:</strong> https://albertaaviatio
 nmuseum.com/events/open-cockpit-day/</li><li><strong>Explore Edmonton:</st
 rong> https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/open-cockpit-day</li></ul
