 31-large.jpg
DESCRIPTION:One night\, four families\, and music carried across generatio
 ns.\n\nGenerations is a celebration of the musical roots of Edmonton’s f
 olk community\, where songs and stories are passed from parent to child an
 d carried forward once again. Four remarkable musical families come togeth
 er on one stage for an evening of connection\, tradition\, and shared heri
 tage.\n\nWendy Gregson joins daughter Renee McLachlin and granddaughters R
 uby and Bella with music from their beautiful Mother Tree project\, alongs
 ide folk veteran Gord Matthews and his son Travis.\n\nThe second set featu
 res acclaimed songwriter Billie Zizi with her father\, world-travelled fid
 dler Cam Neufeld and Road to Django\, joined by rising artist Kaiya Kodie 
 performing with her father Jason.\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLocation: New Moon
  Folk Club - 10819 71 Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nExplore Edmonton: htt
 ps://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/generations-at-the-new-moon-folk-c
 lub
LAST-MODIFIED:20260809T022836Z
LOCATION:New Moon Folk Club - 10819 71 Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/generations-at-the-new-moon
 -folk-club
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>One night\, four families\, and music carr
 ied across generations.</p><p>Generations is a celebration of the musical 
 roots of Edmonton’s folk community\, where songs and stories are passed 
 from parent to child and carried forward once again. Four remarkable music
 al families come together on one stage for an evening of connection\, trad
 ition\, and shared heritage.</p><p>Wendy Gregson joins daughter Renee McLa
 chlin and granddaughters Ruby and Bella with music from their beautiful Mo
 ther Tree project\, alongside folk veteran Gord Matthews and his son Travi
 s.</p><p>The second set features acclaimed songwriter Billie Zizi with her
  father\, world-travelled fiddler Cam Neufeld and Road to Django\, joined 
 by rising artist Kaiya Kodie performing with her father Jason.</p><h3>Even
 t Information</h3><ul><li><strong>Location:</strong> New Moon Folk Club - 
 10819 71 Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA</li><li><strong>Explore Edmonton:</
 strong> https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/generations-at-the-new-
