END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Canadian Finals Rodeo & CFR Week
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261007
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261011
DTSTAMP:20260809T022900Z
UID:48cda86446d4e00e8f930d9d538152e7@explore-edmonton-calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/BR_Gra
 dyYoung_ChesterA.jpg
DESCRIPTION:It’s that time of year again\, CFR is here!\n\nThe champions
 hip is in town\, bringing Edmonton’s biggest Western celebration to life
 . Whether you're a lifelong rodeo fan or discovering it for the first time
 \, CFR is more than just a competition\; it’s a city-wide celebration of
  music\, fashion\, and elite athleticism! Plus\, you don’t need a ticket
  to the dirt to enjoy the Western spirit!\n\nCanadian Country Expo A six-d
 ay celebration of Western lifestyle featuring a massive trade show and the
  Western Showcase. Explore boutique shopping\, tack\, art\, and furniture\
 , plus catch live experiences like Youth Rodeo\, Bullfighting\, contestant
  autograph sessions\, and daily buffet offerings. There's something new ar
 ound every corner!\n\nThe Tailgate Party (Ice District\, Rogers Place) The
  ultimate pre-show gathering spot with live music\, interactive displays\,
  and great food and drinks. It's the perfect place to get into the rodeo s
 pirit before the main performance.\n\nThe After-Party When the competition
  ends\, the energy keeps going with live country music and dancing in the 
 Ice District Fan Tent. Expect a high-energy crowd and late-night celebrati
 ons!\n\nCFR showcases the best of rodeo sport\, from powerful roughstock r
 ides to lightning-fast timed events and precision women’s competitions.\
 n\nRoughstock Events Bull Riding\, Saddle Bronc\, and Bareback Riding test
  balance\, strength\, and control on bucking animals in intense eight-seco
 nd rides.\n\nTimed Events Steer Wrestling\, Tie-Down Roping\, and Team Rop
 ing challenge speed\, coordination\, and teamwork in fast-paced arena acti
 on.\n\nWomen’s Events Barrel Racing delivers high-speed precision around
  a cloverleaf pattern\, while Breakaway Roping highlights quick reflexes a
 nd split-second timing.\n\nGetting around CFR Week is simple and stress-fr
 ee. A free shuttle runs between the Edmonton EXPO Centre and Rogers Place 
 throughout the event! Spend your day at the Canadian Country Expo\, then r
 ide the shuttle to the rodeo performance downtown. After the show\, shuttl
 e service returns you to the EXPO Centre\, making it easy to enjoy both ve
 nues without hassle!\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLocation: Rogers Place - 10220 
 104 Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nVisit / Tickets: https://www.cfr.ca/\nE
 xplore Edmonton: https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/canadian-final
 s-rodeo-cfr-week
