 overing it for the first time\, CFR is more than just a competition\; it
 ’s a city-wide celebration of music\, fashion\, and elite athleticism! P
 lus\, you don’t need a ticket to the dirt to enjoy the Western spirit!</
 p><p>Canadian Country Expo A six-day celebration of Western lifestyle feat
 uring a massive trade show and the Western Showcase. Explore boutique shop
 ping\, tack\, art\, and furniture\, plus catch live experiences like Youth
  Rodeo\, Bullfighting\, contestant autograph sessions\, and daily buffet o
 fferings. There&#x27\;s something new around every corner!</p><p>The Tailg
 ate Party (Ice District\, Rogers Place) The ultimate pre-show gathering sp
 ot with live music\, interactive displays\, and great food and drinks. It&
 #x27\;s the perfect place to get into the rodeo spirit before the main per
 formance.</p><p>The After-Party When the competition ends\, the energy kee
 ps going with live country music and dancing in the Ice District Fan Tent.
  Expect a high-energy crowd and late-night celebrations!</p><p>CFR showcas
 es the best of rodeo sport\, from powerful roughstock rides to lightning-f
 ast timed events and precision women’s competitions.</p><p>Roughstock Ev
 ents Bull Riding\, Saddle Bronc\, and Bareback Riding test balance\, stren
 gth\, and control on bucking animals in intense eight-second rides.</p><p>
 Timed Events Steer Wrestling\, Tie-Down Roping\, and Team Roping challenge
  speed\, coordination\, and teamwork in fast-paced arena action.</p><p>Wom
 en’s Events Barrel Racing delivers high-speed precision around a cloverl
 eaf pattern\, while Breakaway Roping highlights quick reflexes and split-s
 econd timing.</p><p>Getting around CFR Week is simple and stress-free. A f
 ree shuttle runs between the Edmonton EXPO Centre and Rogers Place through
 out the event! Spend your day at the Canadian Country Expo\, then ride the
  shuttle to the rodeo performance downtown. After the show\, shuttle servi
 ce returns you to the EXPO Centre\, making it easy to enjoy both venues wi
 thout hassle!</p><h3>Event Information</h3><ul><li><strong>Location:</stro
 ng> Rogers Place - 10220 104 Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA</li><li><strong
 >Visit / Tickets:</strong> https://www.cfr.ca/</li><li><strong>Explore Edm
 onton:</strong> https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/canadian-finals
 -rodeo-cfr-week</li></ul>
