DESCRIPTION:Incredible nonfiction content comes to life.\n\nEvery October\
 , LitFest transforms Edmonton’s downtown into a creative hub for readers
  and writers who love true stories. Over five days\, LitFest offers its au
 dience author readings\, panels\, and workshops with some of today’s mos
 t exciting nonfiction voices!\n\nIn its 20th year as Canada’s first and 
 only nonfiction literary festival\, LitFest will once again bring bestsell
 ing authors\, award-winning journalists\, emerging voices\, and local stor
 ytellers to the stage.\n\nWhether you're an avid reader\, an aspiring writ
 er\, or simply someone who enjoys thoughtful conversations\, LitFest offer
 s something for everyone. Discover new ideas\, find your next favourite bo
 ok\, meet remarkable authors\, and become part of a vibrant community that
  believes stories have the power to change the world.\n\nEVENT INFORMATION
 \nLocation: Various Venues\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nVisit / Tickets: htt
 ps://litfestalberta.org/\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploreedmonton.com/ev
 ent-calendar/litfest
LAST-MODIFIED:20260809T022842Z
LOCATION:Various Venues\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/litfest
