 reative hub for readers and writers who love true stories. Over five days\
 , LitFest offers its audience author readings\, panels\, and workshops wit
 h some of today’s most exciting nonfiction voices!</p><p>In its 20th yea
 r as Canada’s first and only nonfiction literary festival\, LitFest will
  once again bring bestselling authors\, award-winning journalists\, emergi
 ng voices\, and local storytellers to the stage.</p><p>Whether you&#x27\;r
 e an avid reader\, an aspiring writer\, or simply someone who enjoys thoug
 htful conversations\, LitFest offers something for everyone. Discover new 
