DESCRIPTION:A must-see trio performance!\n\nJoin the Edmonton Chamber Musi
 c Society for the internationally acclaimed Busch Trio as they revive earl
 y-twentieth-century chamber traditions!\n\nRenowned for their captivating 
 ensemble playing\, the trio performs on historic gut strings\, anchored by
  a rare 1783 Guadagnini violin. They have released several celebrated reco
 rdings for Alpha Classics\, including works by Dvořák\, Schubert\, Ravel
 \, and Shostakovich.\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLocation: Trinity Lutheran Chur
 ch\, 10014 81 Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nExplore Edmonton: https://exp
 loreedmonton.com/event-calendar/busch-trio-edmonton-chamber-music-society
