DESCRIPTION:Fall in love with exquisite food and wine pairings this Octobe
 r.\n\nThe Marc invites you to step away from the ordinary and into the gol
 den vineyards of Burgundy for an evening built around one of France’s mo
 st storied wine-producing families!\n\nThe Marc is honoured to host a spec
 ial guest who will guide guests through five exceptional wines (including 
 a rare Premier Cru!) each one poured with the stories and philosophy of th
 e estate behind it.\n\nGuests will enjoy an expertly paired five-course me
 nu. The evening begins with Ravioles de Royans aux Truffes alongside a bri
 ght Mercurey Blanc\, followed by an Époisses cheese tart. The menu contin
 ues with seared duck breast and Boeuf Bourguignon \, each paired with two 
 distinctive expressions of Nuits-Saint-Georges\, including the acclaimed 1
 er Cru Terres Blanches . A Nonnettes -style Opera Cake brings the evening 
 to a graceful close on a delicately sweet note.\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLoca
 tion: The Marc - 9940 106 St\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nExplore Edmonton: 
 https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/an-evening-in-burgundy-wine-din
