DESCRIPTION:A must-see performance!\n\nThis show follows Alice\, who is ov
 er 60\, nearly divorced\, and moving in with her adult son and his family.
  As she tries to reinvent herself and maybe recapture a bit of her lost yo
 uth\, she reconnects with her estranged college roommate\, Corinne\, and t
 ogether they decide to start a heavy metal garage band.\n\nWhen Rita\, a s
 easoned career musician\, answers their ad for a drummer\, she brings an u
 nexpected spark of energy that shakes things up. Together\, the three wome
 n are forced to confront their choices\, challenge their limits\, and disc
 over what it really means to start over.\n\nOctober is Queer History Month
 !\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLocation: Studio Theatre Inside Fringe Theatre Adv
 entures - 10330 84 Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nVisit / Tickets: https:/
 /northernlighttheatre.com/2026-2027-season/iron-matron/\nExplore Edmonton:
