 llows Alice\, who is over 60\, nearly divorced\, and moving in with her ad
 ult son and his family. As she tries to reinvent herself and maybe recaptu
 re a bit of her lost youth\, she reconnects with her estranged college roo
 mmate\, Corinne\, and together they decide to start a heavy metal garage b
 and.</p><p>When Rita\, a seasoned career musician\, answers their ad for a
  drummer\, she brings an unexpected spark of energy that shakes things up.
  Together\, the three women are forced to confront their choices\, challen
 ge their limits\, and discover what it really means to start over.</p><p>O
