DESCRIPTION:Experience Colin Linden live onstage this fall!\n\nA genuine r
 enaissance man of roots music\, Colin Linden is a Grammy-winning guitarist
 \, singer\, songwriter\, and producer whose soulful blend of blues\, folk\
 , and Americana has taken him from Toronto coffeehouses to Nashville’s b
 iggest stages. He has also played on more than 500 albums and produced ove
 r 140\, working with legends like Bruce Cockburn\, Bob Dylan\, Keb’ Mo
 ’\, and Lucinda Williams!\n\nOnstage at New Moon Folk Club\, expect mast
 erful guitar work\, gritty vocals\, and stories from a lifetime in music\,
  in an intimate concert that feels like sitting in the studio with one of 
 roots music’s true heavyweights.\n\nYour guide to celebrating National I
 ndigenous History Month in Edmonton\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLocation: New Mo
 on Folk Club - 10819 71 Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nExplore Edmonton: h
 ttps://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/colin-linden-at-the-new-moon-fol
 k-club
