SUMMARY:The Citadel Theatre: The Great Gatsby
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261123
DTSTAMP:20260809T022900Z
UID:9296339a69db6133a578199bf7e8801a@explore-edmonton-calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/Explor
 e-Edmonton_Citadel-Theatre_Things-to-Do_Theatre_1.JPG
DESCRIPTION:Experience this powerful\, ground-breaking\, and deeply moving
  show.\n\nStep into the glittering excess of the Jazz Age\, where champagn
 e flows\, flapper dresses shimmer\, and music drifts through the night unt
 il dawn. At the center of it all stands the opulent mansion of mysterious 
 millionaire Jay Gatsby\, whose legendary parties draw eccentric New Yorker
 s from every corner of the city. Yet for all the spectacle\, Gatsby himsel
 f remains an enigma. Driven to reunite with his long-lost love Daisy\, Gat
 sby risks everything to reclaim a dream that may no longer exist.\n\nIllus
 ion and reality collide in this truly incredible stage adaptation of F. Sc
 ott Fitzgerald’s novel\, re-envisioned by Canadian playwright Erin Shiel
 ds and brought to life with a live jazz band!\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLocati
 on: Citadel Theatre - 9828 101A Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nExplore Edm
 onton: https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/the-citadel-theatre-the-
 great-gatsby
LAST-MODIFIED:20260809T022854Z
LOCATION:Citadel Theatre - 9828 101A Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/the-citadel-theatre-the-gre
 at-gatsby
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>Experience this powerful\, ground-breaking
 \, and deeply moving show.</p><p>Step into the glittering excess of the Ja
 zz Age\, where champagne flows\, flapper dresses shimmer\, and music drift
 s through the night until dawn. At the center of it all stands the opulent
  mansion of mysterious millionaire Jay Gatsby\, whose legendary parties dr
 aw eccentric New Yorkers from every corner of the city. Yet for all the sp
 ectacle\, Gatsby himself remains an enigma. Driven to reunite with his lon
 g-lost love Daisy\, Gatsby risks everything to reclaim a dream that may no
  longer exist.</p><p>Illusion and reality collide in this truly incredible
  stage adaptation of F. Scott Fitzgerald’s novel\, re-envisioned by Cana
 dian playwright Erin Shields and brought to life with a live jazz band!</p
 ><h3>Event Information</h3><ul><li><strong>Location:</strong> Citadel Thea
 tre - 9828 101A Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA</li><li><strong>Explore Edmo
 nton:</strong> https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/the-citadel-thea
 tre-the-great-gatsby</li></ul>
X-IMAGE:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/Explore-Edmonton_Citadel
 -Theatre_Things-to-Do_Theatre_1.JPG
