BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Broadway Across Canada Presents Disney’s Beauty and the Beast
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261117
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261123
DTSTAMP:20260809T022900Z
UID:1bad18c61257f5e942bd4eef4a6eb105@explore-edmonton-calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/Jubile
 e-114.JPG
DESCRIPTION:The beloved musical that brings Disney magic to life!\n\nBe Ou
 r Guest at Disney’s enchanting and beloved musical of Beauty and the Bea
 st\, the breathtaking musical filled with the romance and grandeur audienc
 es know and love. This enchanting and timeless tale has been brought to li
 fe like never before\, with spectacular new sets and dazzling costumes. Th
 e show boasts the Oscar®️-winning and Tony Award®️-nominated score\,
  including the classic songs “Be Our Guest” and “Beauty and the Beas
 t.”\n\nReuniting to create this new production are members of the origin
 al Tony Award®️-winning artistic team\, including composer Alan Menken\
 , lyricist Tim Rice\, book writer Linda Woolverton\, with direction and ch
 oreography by Matt West\, scenic design by Stanley A. Meyer\, costume desi
 gn by Ann Hould-Ward and lighting design by Natasha Katz.\n\nEVENT INFORMA
 TION\nLocation: Northern Alberta Jubilee Auditorium - 11455 87 Ave\, Edmon
 ton\, Alberta\, CA\nVisit / Tickets: https://edmonton.broadway.com/shows/b
 eauty-and-the-beast/\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploreedmonton.com/event-
 calendar/broadway-across-canada-presents-disneys-beauty-and-the-beast
LAST-MODIFIED:20260809T022822Z
LOCATION:Northern Alberta Jubilee Auditorium - 11455 87 Ave\, Edmonton\, A
 lberta\, CA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/broadway-across-canada-pres
 ents-disneys-beauty-and-the-beast
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>The beloved musical that brings Disney mag
 ic to life!</p><p>Be Our Guest at Disney’s enchanting and beloved musica
 l of Beauty and the Beast\, the breathtaking musical filled with the roman
 ce and grandeur audiences know and love. This enchanting and timeless tale
  has been brought to life like never before\, with spectacular new sets an
 d dazzling costumes. The show boasts the Oscar®️-winning and Tony Award
 ®️-nominated score\, including the classic songs “Be Our Guest” and
  “Beauty and the Beast.”</p><p>Reuniting to create this new production
  are members of the original Tony Award®️-winning artistic team\, inclu
 ding composer Alan Menken\, lyricist Tim Rice\, book writer Linda Woolvert
 on\, with direction and choreography by Matt West\, scenic design by Stanl
 ey A. Meyer\, costume design by Ann Hould-Ward and lighting design by Nata
 sha Katz.</p><h3>Event Information</h3><ul><li><strong>Location:</strong> 
 Northern Alberta Jubilee Auditorium - 11455 87 Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, 
 CA</li><li><strong>Visit / Tickets:</strong> https://edmonton.broadway.com
 /shows/beauty-and-the-beast/</li><li><strong>Explore Edmonton:</strong> ht
 tps://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/broadway-across-canada-presents-d
 isneys-beauty-and-the-beast</li></ul>
