 -Line-LRT-Fall-large.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Experience Mia Kelly & Eliza Mary Doyle live at the New Moon F
 olk Club!\n\nTwo powerhouse voices on one unforgettable night at New Moon 
 Folk Club. Eliza Mary Doyle brings feisty\, banjo‑driven alt‑country/f
 olk\, all high‑octane energy\, sharp songwriting\, and "sweet as honey a
 nd raw as hide" delivery. Sharing the bill\, rising star Mia Kelly offers 
 a soulful\, bilingual blend of folk\, rock\, and blues\, pairing a stunnin
 g voice with poetic\, emotionally rich storytelling. Together\, they deliv
 er a double-dose of fearless songwriting\, virtuosic musicianship\, and bi
 g-hearted stage presence - an intimate\, high-energy evening where songs\,
  stories\, and harmonies shine.\n\nYour guide to celebrating National Indi
 genous History Month in Edmonton\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLocation: New Moon 
 Folk Club - 10819 71 Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nExplore Edmonton: http
 s://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/double-bill-mia-kelly-eliza-mary-do
 yle
