SUMMARY:Disney's The Muppet Christmas Carol in Concert
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261211
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261213
DTSTAMP:20260809T022900Z
UID:55e6a497545bf8fc42b33e26bfc3051e@explore-edmonton-calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/Muppet
 s-NAJA-2026-1920x1080-1.png
DESCRIPTION:Don't miss this holiday favourite!\n\nAfter sold-out shows in 
 cities across Canada\, The Muppet Christmas Carol in Concert is coming to 
 Edmonton\, featuring a screening of the complete film with its iconic musi
 cal score performed live to picture.\n\nThe Muppets perform the classic Ch
 arles Dickens holiday tale\, with Kermit the Frog playing Bob Cratchit\, t
 he put-upon clerk of stingy Ebenezer Scrooge. Gonzo\, as Dickens\, narrate
 s the story with the help of Rizzo the Rat. The film also features Miss Pi
 ggy as Emily Cratchit\, Gonzo as the narrator Charles Dickens\, Fozzie Bea
 r as Fozziwig\, and Robin the Frog as Tiny Tim. Scrooge is visited by the 
 spirits of Christmas Past\, Present\, and Future\, each revealing the impa
 ct of his self-serving ways.\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLocation: Northern Albe
 rta Jubilee Auditorium - 1455 87 Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nExplore Ed
 monton: https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/disneys-the-muppet-chri
 stmas-carol-in-concert
LAST-MODIFIED:20260809T022829Z
LOCATION:Northern Alberta Jubilee Auditorium - 1455 87 Ave\, Edmonton\, Al
 berta\, CA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/disneys-the-muppet-christma
 s-carol-in-concert
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>Don&#x27\;t miss this holiday favourite!</
 p><p>After sold-out shows in cities across Canada\, The Muppet Christmas C
 arol in Concert is coming to Edmonton\, featuring a screening of the compl
 ete film with its iconic musical score performed live to picture.</p><p>Th
 e Muppets perform the classic Charles Dickens holiday tale\, with Kermit t
 he Frog playing Bob Cratchit\, the put-upon clerk of stingy Ebenezer Scroo
 ge. Gonzo\, as Dickens\, narrates the story with the help of Rizzo the Rat
 . The film also features Miss Piggy as Emily Cratchit\, Gonzo as the narra
 tor Charles Dickens\, Fozzie Bear as Fozziwig\, and Robin the Frog as Tiny
  Tim. Scrooge is visited by the spirits of Christmas Past\, Present\, and 
 Future\, each revealing the impact of his self-serving ways.</p><h3>Event 
 Information</h3><ul><li><strong>Location:</strong> Northern Alberta Jubile
 e Auditorium - 1455 87 Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA</li><li><strong>Explo
 re Edmonton:</strong> https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/disneys-t
 he-muppet-christmas-carol-in-concert</li></ul>
