 onal tournaments\, the World Juniors will see 10 national teams compete fo
 r gold. Rogers Place will serve as the primary competition venue\, hosting
  17 games (including the semifinals and medal games!) while additional mat
 chups will take place in Red Deer.</p><p>Co-hosted by Edmonton and Red Dee
 r\, the 2027 IIHF World Junior Championship continues Alberta’s proud tr
 adition of hosting world-class hockey events and welcoming fans from aroun
