 s headed to you in this internationally acclaimed hit musical critics call
  “wonderful\, heart-warming\, and laugh-out-loud funny” (Manchester Ev
 ening News) and “a feel-good\, family-friendly comedy that delivers” (
 The Hollywood Reporter). Based on the beloved film\, Mrs. Doubtfire tells 
 the hysterical and heartfelt story of an out-of-work actor who will do any
 thing for his kids. It's a beloved\, heart-felt classic!\n\nEVENT INFORMAT
 ION\nLocation: Northern Alberta Jubilee Auditorium - 11455 87 Ave\, Edmont
 on\, Alberta\, CA\nVisit / Tickets: https://edmonton.broadway.com/shows/mr
