BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Waltz
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270218
DTSTAMP:20260809T022900Z
UID:0b64a78f13c59f15e9e652b37c0e8b70@explore-edmonton-calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/featur
 e/Varscona.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Shadow Theatre presents a heartfelt coming-of-age story.\n\nEd
 monton’s premier live professional theatre company\, Shadow Theatre\, ce
 lebrates emerging Filipino artists with a heartfelt Filipino-Canadian stor
 y of young love.\n\nSet on the doorstep of a rustic cabin in northeastern 
 Saskatchewan\, the play follows two Filipino-Canadian teenagers whose live
 s are unexpectedly intertwined. Over the course of a single evening\, they
  share stories\, dreams\, and music from a boombox beneath the vast Saskat
 chewan sky. Charming\, nostalgic\, and inspired by the spirit of the '90s\
 , this new Canadian play is a coming-of-age love story about connection\, 
 identity\, and possibility.\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLocation: Varscona Theat
 re - 10329 83 Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nExplore Edmonton: https://exp
 loreedmonton.com/event-calendar/the-waltz
