X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>Shadow Theatre presents a heartfelt coming
 -of-age story.</p><p>Edmonton’s premier live professional theatre compan
 y\, Shadow Theatre\, celebrates emerging Filipino artists with a heartfelt
  Filipino-Canadian story of young love.</p><p>Set on the doorstep of a rus
 tic cabin in northeastern Saskatchewan\, the play follows two Filipino-Can
 adian teenagers whose lives are unexpectedly intertwined. Over the course 
 of a single evening\, they share stories\, dreams\, and music from a boomb
 ox beneath the vast Saskatchewan sky. Charming\, nostalgic\, and inspired 
 by the spirit of the &#x27\;90s\, this new Canadian play is a coming-of-ag
 e love story about connection\, identity\, and possibility.</p><h3>Event I
 nformation</h3><ul><li><strong>Location:</strong> Varscona Theatre - 10329
  83 Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA</li><li><strong>Explore Edmonton:</stron
