 ions of love and family. When suitors\, both suitable and otherwise\, star
 t courting the Dashwood girls\, the sisters must blend sense with sensibil
 ity to protect their hearts and their reputations. Full of heart and brist
 ling with wit\, this is a boldly unique reimagining of this much-loved rom
