 onton this winter!</p><p>The Unfaithful Servants bring their high‑energy
  &quot\;newgrass&quot\; sound to New Moon Folk Club\, delivering explosive
  instrumentals\, rich harmonies\, and gripping songs that push bluegrass\,
  folk\, and Americana into fresh territory. Led by Grammy‑nominated mand
 olinist Jesse Cobb (a founding member of The Infamous Stringdusters) and p
 rolific songwriter Dylan Stone\, the Vancouver Island quartet has quickly 
 become one of Canada’s must‑see acoustic acts\, earning festival slots
 \, rave reviews\, and a Canadian Folk Music Award nomination!</p><h3>Event
  Information</h3><ul><li><strong>Location:</strong> New Moon Folk Club - 1
