ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/Citade
 lTheatre-4-medium.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Experience The Citadel Theatre situated in Edmonton's Arts Dis
 trict!\n\nWhen Jesse and Adam fall in love\, life speeds up fast. An unexp
 ected pregnancy brings two families together\, Métis and settler\, creati
 ng laughs\, surfacing buried history\, and revealing plenty of heart. Adam
 ’s family is loud\, loving\, and shaped by generations of historical inj
 ustice\, while Adam searches for his own voice. When he turns to playwriti
 ng\, everything comes to the surface. Inspired by stories from the playwri
 ghts’ own lives\, this smart\, funny\, and deeply human comedy celebrate
 s love\, identity\, and the beautiful chaos of family.\n\nEVENT INFORMATIO
 N\nLocation: Citadel Theatre - 9828 101A Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nEx
 plore Edmonton: https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/the-comeback-ci
 tadel-theatre
LAST-MODIFIED:20260809T022855Z
LOCATION:Citadel Theatre - 9828 101A Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/the-comeback-citadel-theatr
 e
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>Experience The Citadel Theatre situated in
  Edmonton&#x27\;s Arts District!</p><p>When Jesse and Adam fall in love\, 
 life speeds up fast. An unexpected pregnancy brings two families together\
 , Métis and settler\, creating laughs\, surfacing buried history\, and re
 vealing plenty of heart. Adam’s family is loud\, loving\, and shaped by 
 generations of historical injustice\, while Adam searches for his own voic
 e. When he turns to playwriting\, everything comes to the surface. Inspire
 d by stories from the playwrights’ own lives\, this smart\, funny\, and 
 deeply human comedy celebrates love\, identity\, and the beautiful chaos o
 f family.</p><h3>Event Information</h3><ul><li><strong>Location:</strong> 
 Citadel Theatre - 9828 101A Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA</li><li><strong>
 Explore Edmonton:</strong> https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/the-
 comeback-citadel-theatre</li></ul>
X-IMAGE:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/CitadelTheatre-4-medium.
 jpg
END:VEVENT
