ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/Come-F
 rom-Away-Arts-Club-Explore-Edmonton.jpg
DESCRIPTION:A heartwarming show about community connection and resilience.
 \n\nWhen a worldwide travel disruption leaves 7\,000 passengers stranded\,
  the small town of Gander\, Newfoundland welcomes them with open hearts. F
 ear and uncertainty give way to friendship\, generosity\, and unexpected c
 onnections. Inspired by true events\, this Tony-nominated musical celebrat
 es the power of community and the kindness that emerges in difficult times
 . Filled with memorable songs and moving stories\, it is a heartfelt remin
 der of the strength of ordinary people and the extraordinary ways we can c
 are for one another.\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nLocation: Citadel Theatre - 982
 8 101A Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nVisit / Tickets: https://citadelthea
 tre.com/productions/come-from-away-26/\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploree
 dmonton.com/event-calendar/come-from-away-2027
LAST-MODIFIED:20260809T022827Z
LOCATION:Citadel Theatre - 9828 101A Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/come-from-away-2027
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>A heartwarming show about community connec
 tion and resilience.</p><p>When a worldwide travel disruption leaves 7\,00
 0 passengers stranded\, the small town of Gander\, Newfoundland welcomes t
 hem with open hearts. Fear and uncertainty give way to friendship\, genero
 sity\, and unexpected connections. Inspired by true events\, this Tony-nom
 inated musical celebrates the power of community and the kindness that eme
 rges in difficult times. Filled with memorable songs and moving stories\, 
 it is a heartfelt reminder of the strength of ordinary people and the extr
 aordinary ways we can care for one another.</p><h3>Event Information</h3><
 ul><li><strong>Location:</strong> Citadel Theatre - 9828 101A Ave\, Edmont
 on\, Alberta\, CA</li><li><strong>Visit / Tickets:</strong> https://citade
 ltheatre.com/productions/come-from-away-26/</li><li><strong>Explore Edmont
 on:</strong> https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/come-from-away-202
 7</li></ul>
X-IMAGE:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/Come-From-Away-Arts-Club
 -Explore-Edmonton.jpg
